WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.183 --> 00:00:14.148
The animals tried to stop Mowgli.

2
00:00:15.189 --> 00:00:17.551
But he was already racing toward the village.

3
00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:24.115
By twilight he reached the grazing grounds.

4
00:00:26.076 --> 00:00:27.777
Fear jumped up in his throat.

5
00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:31.220
Everyone was in from the fields early.

6
00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:35.774
Instead of preparing dinner, people were gathered under the fig tree.

7
00:00:36.614 --> 00:00:38.215
They were shouting angrily.

8
00:00:42.616 --> 00:00:44.437
Mowgli crept to Messua’s hut.

9
00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:50.500
Peeking through a window, he saw Messua's husband tied to the bed.

10
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.261
Messua lay on the floor, bound and gagged.

11
00:00:55.662 --> 00:00:58.483
She was breathing hard and groaning in pain.

12
00:01:00.103 --> 00:01:01.084
Mowgli gasped.

13
00:01:01.724 --> 00:01:03.605
Messua had been badly beaten!

14
00:01:04.925 --> 00:01:07.346
Mowgli knew the habits of the villagers well.

15
00:01:08.346 --> 00:01:12.687
As long as the people could eat and talk, they would stay under the tree.

16
00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:17.748
But they would come when Buldeo returned to the village—without Mowgli.

17
00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:21.349
He slipped through the window of the hut.

18
00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:27.071
Bending over Messua and her husband, he cut their ties.

19
00:01:28.431 --> 00:01:30.972
Messua looked like she was in terrible pain.

20
00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:36.083
Mowgli put his hand over her mouth to stop her from screaming.

21
00:01:36.103 --> 00:01:41.768
"I knew you would come," Messua sobbed.

22
00:01:41.788 --> 00:01:44.710
"I knew you were my son!"

23
00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.092
"Who did this to you?"

24
00:01:48.493 --> 00:01:49.433
Mowgli demanded.

25
00:01:49.453 --> 00:01:53.617
"The whole village," Messua's husband answered.

26
00:01:53.637 --> 00:01:57.700
"They think we are rich sorcerers who are using magic."

27
00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:02.063
Mowgli was confused by all the talk about magic.

28
00:02:02.663 --> 00:02:05.045
"What is a sorcerer exactly?"

29
00:02:05.065 --> 00:02:08.888
"See!" Messua said to her husband.

30
00:02:08.908 --> 00:02:11.010
"He's no sorcerer.

31
00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.611
He's my son!"

32
00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:16.875
"Son or sorcerer, what does it matter?"

33
00:02:17.195 --> 00:02:18.116
the man answered.

34
00:02:18.136 --> 00:02:20.017
"We're going to die."

35
00:02:21.138 --> 00:02:22.940
Mowgli pointed through the window.

36
00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.641
"You're free now.

37
00:02:25.042 --> 00:02:27.664
Go." “Go where?"

38
00:02:28.304 --> 00:02:30.606
Messua's eyes were wide and frightened.

39
00:02:30.626 --> 00:02:33.008
"We don't know the jungle well.

40
00:02:33.649 --> 00:02:34.630
And I'm injured.

41
00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.892
I can't walk very fast."

42
00:02:38.273 --> 00:02:41.455
"The villagers will follow us," her husband added.

43
00:02:41.475 --> 00:02:43.257
"It's hopeless."

44
00:02:45.339 --> 00:02:48.762
From outside, Mowgli heard shouting and trampling.

45
00:02:48.782 --> 00:02:52.385
"It sounds like Buldeo has returned.

46
00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:54.427
Think about where you will go.

47
00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:55.868
I'll be right back."

48
00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:01.103
He bounded through the window and crept back to the tree.

49
00:03:03.244 --> 00:03:06.407
Buldeo lay on the ground, coughing and groaning.

50
00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:09.309
The crowd was yelling out questions.

51
00:03:09.329 --> 00:03:12.451
"Did you kill the boy?"

52
00:03:12.471 --> 00:03:15.213
"Did he use magic again?"

53
00:03:17.314 --> 00:03:20.456
Buldeo mumbled something and then called for water.

54
00:03:20.476 --> 00:03:23.578
"First a drink.

55
00:03:24.259 --> 00:03:25.880
Then I'll tell you my story."

56
00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.681
"Bah!" Mowgli said to himself.

57
00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:32.604
"All humans do is talk.

58
00:03:33.144 --> 00:03:35.026
They'll be under the tree forever!"

59
00:03:36.707 --> 00:03:38.208
Mowgli returned to the hut.

60
00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:45.754
Just as he reached the window, he felt a soft touch on his foot.

61
00:03:46.835 --> 00:03:47.636
"Mother Wolf!"

62
00:03:47.656 --> 00:03:51.599
"I followed you into the village, Mowgli.

63
00:03:52.459 --> 00:03:54.661
I wanted to see the woman who took care of you."

64
00:03:56.042 --> 00:03:57.844
"The villagers plan to kill her!"

65
00:03:58.288 --> 00:03:59.709
Mowgli quickly explained.

66
00:03:59.729 --> 00:04:02.630
"Messua must escape through the jungle."

67
00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:06.792
"I will protect her," Mother said.

68
00:04:08.673 --> 00:04:12.455
She slipped back into the darkness to await Mowgli's instructions.

69
00:04:17.197 --> 00:04:20.879
Messua and her husband had decided to go to the next village.

70
00:04:21.639 --> 00:04:23.380
It would take hours to get there.

71
00:04:26.428 --> 00:04:28.209
Mowgli helped them through the window.

72
00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:32.990
In the starlight the jungle looked dark and dangerous.

73
00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.051
"Do you know the way?"

74
00:04:36.511 --> 00:04:37.151
he whispered.

75
00:04:38.291 --> 00:04:39.252
The couple nodded.

76
00:04:39.272 --> 00:04:42.253
"Good. Don't be afraid.

77
00:04:43.053 --> 00:04:45.874
I promise—the jungle will protect you.

78
00:04:46.814 --> 00:04:48.854
Go now and travel slowly.

79
00:04:49.615 --> 00:04:51.015
There's no need to hurry."

80
00:04:52.335 --> 00:04:56.757
Tears streaming down her cheeks, Messua hugged Mowgli good-bye.

81
00:05:00.039 --> 00:05:02.760
Then they headed into the dark jungle.

82
00:05:07.303 --> 00:05:09.144
Mother Wolf silently followed.

83
00:05:11.845 --> 00:05:13.586
Soon someone else appeared.

84
00:05:13.606 --> 00:05:18.169
"Bagheera!" Mowgli quickly explained the situation.

85
00:05:18.189 --> 00:05:21.991
"Buldeo is still telling stories to the villagers.

86
00:05:23.431 --> 00:05:28.077
However, he will stop talking, and then the people will come.

87
00:05:29.018 --> 00:05:32.402
What will we do when the humans find this trap empty?"

88
00:05:32.422 --> 00:05:36.467
"Hmm." Bagheera thought for a moment.

89
00:05:36.487 --> 00:05:38.530
"I have an idea."
